      "key": "FlowerDance_Accept",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Hey, sure. Let's do it. We can be embarrassed together.$h",
      "translation": "Jasně. Jdeme na to. Můžeme se ztrapnit společně.$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "621aecae494a90556b285dfbb93c1f27b7549b0a2886f0d60f1aea325f8f5b3f",
