    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Abigail",
      "key": "AcceptGift_(O)SkillBook_4",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Hey, this is my favorite magazine! My Dad won't let me have a subscription, so I have to get it on the black market like this...$h",
      "translation": "Hej, tohle je můj oblíbený časopis! Táta mi nedovolí si ho předplatit, takže ho musím shánět takhle na černém trhu...$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "f4b8835dde8e68fb3d699b5a64711056b566fc4dc3d2574f695ad417ce4aa736",
      "translationSHA256": "351bb17387584cf8ca8dbe741198715c430bd1a60020fcc2b8b7e10997c11b86",
      "reviewChecks": [
