    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Abigail",
      "key": "AcceptGift_(O)Book_Void",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Whoa, that's a creepy looking book... I love it!#$b#*Flip* *flip* *flip*... Ooh... It's full of monsters...$h#$b#I'll have to study this before going into the caves... Thanks!",
      "translation": "Teda, tahle kniha vypadá děsivě... To se mi líbí!#$b#*Šust* *šust* *šust*... Jé... Je plná příšer...$h#$b#Než vyrazím do jeskyní, budu si ji muset prostudovat... Díky!",
      "sourceSHA256": "2568b256e61a69e4f2fe89fa1abbb6730d7a5189a3b424fdce6c1679d0b1752a",
      "translationSHA256": "190185361a84af4484efb555da8460ddf5bd81887e09ab3744e7d0f45a0b079c",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
