    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Abigail",
      "key": "AcceptGift_(O)109",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Whoa... Where'd you find this? The workmanship is fascinating...#$b#It's a little too rusty to use, but I'll add it to my collection.",
      "translation": "Teda... Kde se to dalo najít? To zpracování je fascinující...#$b#Na používání je to trochu moc rezavé, ale přidám si to do sbírky.",
      "sourceSHA256": "96180b4882a01cf3e1bff21ce3f99eacb6c0adec708aa3355d6f1677f407a772",
      "translationSHA256": "24ec6e0b78128d6cbe26106f4ac1dec566c2075851fd473336359239f26371b2",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Abigail",
      "key": "AcceptGift_(O)119",
      "field": null,
      "source": "This makes you wonder... Thousands of years ago, there was probably a little purple-haired cavewoman who played this flute, just like me.#$b#...I'll have to wash it before pressing it to my lips, though.$h",
      "translation": "Člověka hned napadne... Před tisíci lety nejspíš žila malá jeskynní žena s fialovými vlasy, která stejně jako já hrála na tuto flétnu.#$b#...Než si ji ale přiložím ke rtům, budu ji muset umýt.$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "c342e2d156cc983c63bed23e7d45c520896903cc2ad4831560b0daf1707040e5",
      "translationSHA256": "673f6a1214ac6c8a1b47d75fcc732d0d5a09f8fcb39258198f5aea863594afe1",
