    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Abigail",
      "key": "GreenRain",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I want to go exploring, but I can tell my Mom is kind of worried. I don't want to add to her stress.",
      "translation": "Chci vyrazit na průzkum, ale vidím, že máma má docela starosti. Nechci jí přidělávat další starosti.",
      "sourceSHA256": "8e2091257a6cf1fc37d71fb17637e15f7b2d8498bff9b9d129fa07f6b4852191",
      "translationSHA256": "d82bbfb9fc8661b6bd271ca75d456bbb45989dae7e9dc0730abdf4f9db6cd7cb",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Abigail",
      "key": "GreenRainFinished",
      "field": null,
      "source": "And just like that, everything's back to normal. It's like magic!$h",
      "translation": "A rázem je všechno zase jako dřív. Jako kouzlem!$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "57c06cbbcd8c5a5e0ac4991583e7be4df617f0687fa520a9c33d12b01dd5d30c",
      "translationSHA256": "434fb885d83fafdbad7b1d6586db9220ab23bb47ddabc39143692be9ec869409",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Abigail",
      "key": "GreenRain_2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Have you seen all the crazy trees around town? Everything looks so different... I feel like we're in a fairy world.",
      "translation": "Vidíš všechny ty šílené stromy kolem města? Všechno vypadá úplně jinak... Připadám si jako v pohádkovém světě.",
      "sourceSHA256": "876c74118a426cf65ad31b89c482927adeb3cd8b86b77fbc01b56d3581edfb99",
      "translationSHA256": "bc3bd45693fb6aa33769dbaab20bee183f4ac89c9926290430923ea3642b4027",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Abigail",
      "key": "cc_Begin",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Don't tell anyone, but I snuck into the old community center last night... I think it's haunted!",
      "translation": "Nikomu to neříkej, ale včera v noci jsem se vplížila do starého Komunitního centra... Myslím, že tam straší!",
      "sourceSHA256": "92446acf257a03ad8c3b9fcf89c989473a7465c92b6c75b49366833ae5f99863",
      "translationSHA256": "4f3d0f7a686fb1ca37642bcf357058cd18b0f0ed1589b2abe401d1d17fff6a26",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
