    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Abigail",
      "key": "AcceptGift_(O)279",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Oh, wow... @! Are you sure you want to give this to me? It's so rare!#$b#I'll admit, my mouth is watering already...$h",
      "translation": "Páni... @! Opravdu mi to chceš dát? Je to tak vzácné!#$b#Přiznávám, už se mi sbíhají sliny...$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "d32ff6d5f2b3bc5c0dddc9574ad56b25c79930597762a435e3e23c49a0905948",
